sequenceDiagram
 participant D as Dashboard
 participant C as Precios (C)
 participant S as Strategy
 participant H as Fuente
 D->>C: getDolarQuotes(preferCache)
 alt Memoria vigente
  C-->>D: Datos y timestamp
 else Proveedores ordenados
  loop CriptoYa/DolarApi/DbCache
   C->>S: fetch()
   S->>H: Solicitar formato<br/>propio
   H-->>S: Datos / error
   S->>S: Adapter<br/>normaliza/valida
   S-->>C: DolarQuote / falla
  end
